{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/980447-does-going-loud-offer-extra-demonic-form","id":980447,"title":"Does going loud offer extra Demonic form?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-02T15:32:02-07:00","id":980447,"title":"Does going loud offer extra Demonic form?","content":"Your Demonic form increases with your primum, and Going loud says it gives all the benefits of the increased primum, but gaining extra physical pieces doesn't really make sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-02T17:05:42-07:00","id":980478,"title":"","content":"I've always imagined that Loud form looks even more impressive than the regular one, but not sure about that in gameplay terms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-02T17:09:07-07:00","id":980480,"title":"","content":"Considering you'd also need to add the high Primum incurable permanent glitches, I don't imagine so.<br /> <br /> For most purposes things that give you &quot;permanent&quot; changes are set vs your &quot;permanent&quot; attribute/ability ratings, not any temporary ones (unless the text specifically says so like rolling for a glitch with Going Loud)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1462,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","user":"Xenesis","date":". 10-02-2016, 08:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T06:42:14-07:00","id":980737,"title":"","content":"Not really. The new forms from high Primum represent an evolution of the demon over time as they grow up and further define their own self-awareness. Its not really thematic for you to have brief splurges of evolution that die out after a scene - there's no growing up here, just a brief moment of clarity that fades.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T12:17:43-07:00","id":986296,"title":"","content":"I let my players have additional forms as appropriate when going loud if they wanted them. A couple of extra abilities aren't exactly deal breakers when